    {
      "from": 40.5,
      "to": 47,
      "heading": "The twist",
      "text": "The twist? The water is minus three degrees, but it isn't frozen. Four kilometres of ice squeeze it liquid.",
      "source": "Lake Vostok, Wikipedia",
