    },
    {
      "claim": "Lake Vostok is 250 km long and may have been isolated for 15 to 25 million years",
      "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lake_Vostok"
    },
    {
      "claim": "The lake water averages about −3 °C and stays liquid because of the high pressure from the ice above",
